  "question": {
    "text": "Three balls are marked with <math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>4</mn></math> and <math><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo></math> They are placed in a box and a ball is drawn, its number is noted and the ball drawn is returned to the box. The process is repeated two more times. If the probability of the sum of all the three numbers is&nbsp;<math><mn>12</mn></math> is <math><mi>λ,</mi></math> then <math><mn>108</mn><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
