  "solution": {
    "text": "For the sum of all three numbers to be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math>, the possible cases are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, required probability <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
